   "source": [
    "# Chroma & Lanchain quickstart \n",
    "\n",
    "In this notebook we will try to see how to interact with chomadb and langchain in order to wrap all this into a script for the next activities 🤗\n",
    "\n",
    "## Chroma docker container \n",
    "\n",
    "First you've must run chroma inside docker with the command below : \n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "docker run -d \\\n",
    "  --name chroma-db \\\n",
    "  -p 8001:8001 \\\n",
    "  -e ALLOW_RESET=true \\\n",
    "  -e ANONYMIZED_TELEMETRY=false \\\n",
    "  -e CHROMA_SERVER_AUTH_CREDENTIALS_ENABLE=false \\\n",
    "  -e CHROMA_SERVER_HTTP_PORT=8000 \\\n",
    "  -v \"$(pwd)/data/chroma:/chroma/chroma\" \\\n",
    "  --network=host \\\n",
    "  ghcr.io/chroma-core/chroma:latest\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "You should have a chroma container running, you can check it with de `docker ps` command. \n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import chromadb\n",
    "from chromadb.utils import embedding_functions\n",
    "from chromadb.config import Settings\n",
    "from langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\n",
    "from langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Connect with no authentication on the port of your choice \n",
    "embeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings(openai_api_key=\"YOUR_KEY\")\n",
    "vectorstore = Chroma(\n",
    "    collection_name=\"my_collection\",\n",
    "    embedding_function=embeddings,\n",
    "    client_settings={\n",
    "        \"chroma_api_impl\": \"chromadb.api.fastapi.FastAPI\",\n",
    "        \"chroma_server_host\": \"localhost\",\n",
    "        \"chroma_server_http_port\": \"8080\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "                                    port=8001,)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "texts = [\n",
    "    \"This is the first document. It contains some introductory content.\",\n",
    "    \"This document is about machine learning and its applications.\",\n",
    "    \"Another document that explains how to use Chroma with LangChain.\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "metadatas = [\n",
    "    {\"topic\": \"introduction\"},\n",
    "    {\"topic\": \"machine_learning\"},\n",
    "    {\"topic\": \"chroma_langchain\"}\n",
    "]\n",
    "vectorstore.add_texts(texts=texts, metadatas=metadatas)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "results = vectorstore.similarity_search(\"machine learning\", k=2)\n",
    "print(results)\n"
   ]
  },
